# Almiras ERP scheduled jobs (supercronic; container TZ=Asia/Riyadh, so all times are Riyadh time, UTC+3, no DST).
# Every line goes through run-job.sh: one run at a time, timeout, JSON log line, Prometheus metrics, alert hook.
# Runs as erp_app (the restricted database role) in the "scheduler" container. Never as the owner role.
#
# min hour dom mon dow   command
