# --- ZATCA e-invoicing (zatca.md) ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# R-20..R-27, R-35: stamp, submit, retry, results, deadline checks. "Schedule it every minute."
*    *    *   *   *     /opt/almiras/bin/run-job.sh zatca_process_queue --timeout 300 -- python manage.py zatca_process_queue
# D-19, R-58 / R-60: retry failed secret-version retirements (R-24 backoff, 1 min doubling to 1 h) and retire
# unreferenced versions after ZATCA_RETIRE_GRACE_MINUTES. Every minute (the first retry is due after 1 min);
# nothing is ever destroyed.
*    *    *   *   *     /opt/almiras/bin/run-job.sh zatca_retire_secrets --timeout 300 -- python manage.py zatca_retire_secrets
# R-10 credential renewal/expiry, R-23/R-35 deadline checks. Daily, after the nightly billing run.
15   1    *   *   *     /opt/almiras/bin/run-job.sh zatca_daily --timeout 1800 -- python manage.py zatca_daily
